DESCRIPTION >
    Cohorts: weekly acquisition cohorts with conversion rate, all-time (no
    date-range param in the source). Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id,
    timestamp is NOT filtered here — matches source exactly, no window bound
    in the live query). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/cohorts.js:20-39
    (queryName 'cohorts_weekly'). Identity rule #19a: GROUP BY distinct_id in
    the inner subquery (canonical stitching key) — confirmed NO argMin/argMax
    (uses MIN/MAX/SUM/CASE WHEN only), bucket-B1-eligible; contrast with
    cohorts_ai (cohorts.js:87), which DOES use argMin and is correctly
    excluded from this batch per the dispatch. Typed-column translation
    (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type.
    No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE cohorts_weekly_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        formatDateTime(min_ts, '%Y-W%V') AS cohort_week,
        COUNT(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS users,
        SUM(is_converted) AS converted_users
    FROM (
        SELECT
            distinct_id,
            MIN(timestamp) AS min_ts,
            MAX(CASE WHEN event_type = '$conversion' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS is_converted
        FROM events
        WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
          AND (event_type = '$pageview' OR event_type = '$conversion')
        GROUP BY distinct_id
        HAVING min_ts IS NOT NULL
    )
    GROUP BY cohort_week
    ORDER BY cohort_week ASC
    LIMIT 500

TYPE endpoint
